Subject: [PATCH v10 16/27] pwm: jz4740: Drop dependency on MACH_INGENIC, use COMPILE_TEST
Date: Sat,  2 Mar 2019 20:34:02 -0300
Message-ID: <20190302233413.14813-17-paul@crapouillou.net>
